      "q": "How much does the federal government spend on NAICS 339112?",
      "a": "The federal government has obligated $1.1B in NAICS 339112 so far in FY2026 to date. Total obligations across recent fiscal years were $2.3B in FY21, $1.1B in FY22, $1.5B in FY23, $2B in FY24, and $1.6B in FY25. Activity this year includes 10,876 awards at an average award size of $97.6K."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy the most NAICS 339112 services?",
      "a": "The Department of Veterans Affairs buys the most NAICS 339112 services, with $899M in FY2026 to date. The Department of Defense is the second-largest buyer with $68M, followed by the Department of Health and Human Services with $61.5M. Other buyers include the Department of Justice at $16.5M and the Department of the Interior at $11.9M."
